        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we are required to pay certain development and regulatory milestone payments for the licensed antibody products, for up to three indications, up to a maximum aggregate amount of $127.5 million, as well as certain commercial milestone payments for certain licensed antibody product net sales achievements, up to a maximum aggregate amount of $275.0 million.",
